cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
title: uav-mpc
abstract: >-
  Real-time nonlinear MPC for a quadrotor on ROS 2 Lyrical Luth, using an
  acados-generated SQP-RTI solver. Speaks standard ROS 2 messages by default;
  a PX4/uXRCE-DDS backend is an optional extra.
authors:
  - family-names: Eimaan
    given-names: Ali
    email: ali.eimaan@icloud.com
    # ORCID to be added once the author profile exists.
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-06
license: BSD-3-Clause
url: https://github.com/Ali-Eimaan/uav-mpc
repository-code: https://github.com/Ali-Eimaan/uav-mpc
keywords:
  - ros2
  - mpc
  - quadrotor
  - acados
  - nonlinear-control
references:
  - type: software
    title: transition-viable-swarm
    relationship: is-derivative-of
    scope: >-
      The OCP structure and the differential-flatness-based reference generation
      in uav-mpc carry over to this distributed MPC-CBF swarm controller.
